229
00:14:41,446 --> 00:14:44,246
<b>¿Te dispararon en la cara, Dave?</b>

230
00:14:46,862 --> 00:14:49,263
<b>A mí me dispararon en la cara.</b>

231
00:14:49,446 --> 00:14:52,487
