273
00:17:37,492 --> 00:17:39,092
<b>AYER</b>

274
00:17:54,075 --> 00:17:55,075
<b>Genial.</b>

275
00:17:57,534 --> 00:17:58,654
<b>Sí, está bien.</b>

276
00:18:10,617 --> 00:18:13,010
<b>Chicas, ¿nos darían un minuto,
