277
00:18:13,034 --> 00:18:14,034
<b>Claro.</b>

278
00:18:17,867 --> 00:18:19,448
<b>Dios mío, mujer.</b>

279
00:18:21,784 --> 00:18:22,784
<b>Mírate.</b>

280
00:18:26,076 --> 00:18:27,076
<b>Hola.</b>

281
00:18:27,326 --> 00:18:28,326
<b>Hola.</b>

282
00:18:33,451 --> 00:18:34,451
<b>Entonces...</b>

283
00:18:34,910 --> 00:18:37,871
<b>¿ahora eres alérgico a los teléfonos?</b>

284
00:18:38,201 --> 00:18:39,594
<b>No, acabo de regresar.</b>

285
00:18:39,618 --> 00:18:43,886
<b>Me suspendieron el celular y no tuve
